   138	def sqrt_prime(a: int, l: int, met) -> int:
   139	    """A square root of the nonzero square a mod the public prime l.
   140	    l == 3 (mod 4): a^{(l+1)/4}.  Otherwise Tonelli--Shanks with the least
   141	    quadratic nonresidue z (found by Euler's criterion; the search is charged
   142	    once per l -- its total over a band is O(#band) on average by Erdos 1961 /
   143	    Pollack 2012; only the secondary design mod4=False uses this branch)."""
